From 729d07f8dcb67da16f6a00857009c3b8b91f761a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:14:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] vk_dump: surface pick (pick.req with NX2NAVI_WATCH_REQ=1):
 the next frame records each draw once more first, scissored to its pass's
 centre pixel inside an occlusion query; logs/pick-<frame>.txt names the draws
 that hit (pass, draw, shaders with cache .spv paths, bindings, c-banks), one
 log line per pass; menu: centre crosshair (pick.req 'crosshair') (#165)

---
